<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 11.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 11.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     Sept 11     Sept 10	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  240.550     239.490     237,040    1.48 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  301.250     301.240     303.640   -0.79 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  159.085     159.290     165.490   -3.87 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.588	46.674	48.410   -3.76 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  374.420     372.100     366.280    2.22 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  141.945     142.140     147.886   -4.02 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.790	15.794	14.975    5.44 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  218.110     218.770     230.135   -5.23 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.886	 1.890	 1.939   -2.73 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.555	 1.557	 1.575   -1.27 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  194.700     194.805     206.030   -5.50 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
